<title>USA: Conair looking at acquisition targets.</title>
<headline>Conair looking at acquisition targets.</headline>
<dateline>GARDEN CITY PARK, N.Y. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conair Corp said Friday that it initiated a merger and acquisition program to strengthen its market share position.</p>
<p>The company said in a release Friday that it has begun talks with several potential acquisition targets in the metropolitan New York area.</p>
